{"_note":"代码活动:本周提交 / 最近提交 / 今天提交三张卡共用。**由 tools/infosource/gen_github_todo.py 生成,不要手改**。\n数的是你名下最近推送的 6 个仓库默认分支上的提交(history),按本地日历日切 7 段 —— 不走贡献图,所以提交邮箱没关联到 GitHub 账号时照样算得对(见 q_activity 的注释)。一条 GraphQL,cost 1。\n排序全用「前缀和算名次 + 按名次取」:最活跃仓库按本周提交倒序,最近提交按时间倒序。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t0","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_S","value":"${_nw}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_a","value":"$[if::(le::(subString::(${_nw_S},5,7),2),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_Y","value":"$[calc::(subString::(${_nw_S},0,4)-${_nw_a})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_M","value":"$[calc::(subString::(${_nw_S},5,7)+12*${_nw_a}-3)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_t","value":"$[calc::((365*${_nw_Y}+(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%4)/4-(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%100)/100+(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%400)/400+((153*${_nw_M}+2)-(153*${_nw_M}+2)%5)/5+subString::(${_nw_S},8,10)-1-719468)*86400000+subString::(${_nw_S},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${_nw_S},14,16)*60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_tm","value":"$[calc::(${t0}-${t0}%60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"off","value":"$[calc::(${_nw_t}-${_tm})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_H","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},HH)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_M","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},mm)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"E0","value":"$[calc::(${_tm}-${_H}*3600000-${_M}*60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_ao","value":"$[if::(ge::(${off},0),${off},calc::(0-${off}))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_oh","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::((${_ao}-${_ao}%3600000)/3600000),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_om","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::((${_ao}%3600000)/60000),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"TZ","value":"$[connect::(if::(ge::(${off},0),+,-),if::(lt::(${_oh},10),connect::(0,${_oh}),${_oh}),:,if::(lt::(${_om},10),connect::(0,${_om}),${_om}))]"},"_note":"时区偏移串 ±HH:MM。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S0","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-0*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd0","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-0*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S1","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-1*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd1","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-1*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S2","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-2*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd2","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-2*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S3","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-3*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd3","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-3*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S4","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-4*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd4","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-4*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S5","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-5*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd5","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-5*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S6","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-6*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dd6","value":"$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-6*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S7","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-7*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S8","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-8*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S9","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-9*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S10","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-10*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S11","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-11*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S12","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-12*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"S13","value":"$[connect::(formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-13*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd),T00:00:00,${TZ})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hdr","value":{"Accept":"application/json","Content-Type":"application/json","User-Agent":"Numable"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"body","value":"{\"query\": \"query{act:viewer{repositories(first:6,orderBy:{field:PUSHED_AT,direction:DESC},ownerAffiliations:[OWNER],isFork:false,isArchived:false){nodes{nameWithOwner url defaultBranchRef{target{...on Commit{d0:history(since:\\\"${S0}\\\"){totalCount} d1:history(since:\\\"${S1}\\\",until:\\\"${S0}\\\"){totalCount} d2:history(since:\\\"${S2}\\\",until:\\\"${S1}\\\"){totalCount} d3:history(since:\\\"${S3}\\\",until:\\\"${S2}\\\"){totalCount} d4:history(since:\\\"${S4}\\\",until:\\\"${S3}\\\"){totalCount} d5:history(since:\\\"${S5}\\\",until:\\\"${S4}\\\"){totalCount} d6:history(since:\\\"${S6}\\\",until:\\\"${S5}\\\"){totalCount} pw:history(since:\\\"${S13}\\\",until:\\\"${S6}\\\"){totalCount} last:history(first:3){nodes{messageHeadline committedDate additions deletions url}}}}}}}} viewer{login}}\"}"}},{"_note":"GraphQL 出错恒返 200、错误在 errors[] 里;没绑 / 令牌失效时是 401。两种情况下 data.viewer 都取不到 → 下面 ok=0,不会假绿。","id":"q","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${body}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"login","value":"${q.data.viewer.login}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(or::(eq::(connect::(k,${login}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.act.repositories.nodes}),k)),0,1)]"},"_note":"判据是 **viewer 有没有回来**,不是任何计数:待办恰好全是 0 是好消息,拿计数判会把「今天很干净」误判成「没取到」。⚠️ 用 `connect::(k,…)` 哨兵拼串再比 —— `eq` 是数字化比较,`eq::(0,)` 恒真(todo.df 2026-08-26 栽过)。\n⚠️ 还要求本条流用到的每一段都回来了(need):GraphQL 部分超时会只让某几个 search 为 null、viewer 照常返回 —— 只看 viewer 会把「没取到」渲成「都处理完了」,提醒也会判假而不是未知(2026-09-25 审查实证)。"},{"_note":"取数失败出口:viewer 没回来 = 这一轮什么都不可信(401 / 断网 / GraphQL 整体出错)。抛错让宿主走失败态 —— 不落封面、回落上次成功的数据、提醒判「未知」不响;报成功就会拿一份全空的数据盖掉好数据。⚠️ 「列表为空」是成功,不在这里判。errorMsg 是诊断串,只进运行日志,写英文。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"github graphql: viewer missing (auth or network)"}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"a0nm","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${q.data.act.repositories.nodes[0].nameWithOwner},)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"a0sn","value":"$[replaceAll::(${a0nm},^.*/,)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"a0has","value":"$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${a0nm}),k),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"a0d0","value":"$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${q.data.act.repositories.nodes[0].defaultBranchRef.target.d0.totalCount},0),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"a0d1","value":"$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${q.data.act.repositories.nodes[0].defaultBranchRef.target.d1.totalCount},0),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"a0d2","value":"$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${q.data.act.repositories.nodes[0].defaultBranchRef.target.d2.totalCount},0),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"a0d3","value":"$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${q.data.act.repositories.nodes[0].defaultBranchRef.target.d3.totalCount},0),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"a0d4","value":"$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${q.data.act.repositories.nodes[0].defaultBranchRef.target.d4.totalCount},0),0)]"}},{"op"